            <ArticleTitle>[COPD and Asthma: same same but different].</ArticleTitle>
            <Pagination>
                <MedlinePgn>233-7</MedlinePgn>
            </Pagination>
            <ELocationID EIdType="doi" ValidYN="Y">10.1024/1661-8157/a000835</ELocationID>
            <Abstract>
                <AbstractText>In clinical practice, differentiation of COPD and asthma is difficult. A case report of an asthma patient with a drifter type of asthma imitating COPD is presented. In this context differences and similarities of both diseases are high-lighted. The definitions of asthma and COPD in international guidelines leave some space to misdiagnosing.</AbstractText>
            </Abstract>
